# Copy to .env and fill in real values. .env is gitignored.
#
# The "Sessions near you" map uses a no-key stack by default (MapLibre GL +
# OpenStreetMap tiles + Zippopotam/Nominatim geocoding), so no token is
# required. If you later switch the map to Mapbox, add its public token here:
#
# PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
